lizalde</surname><given-names>PV</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Progestin-induced caveolin-1 expression mediates breast cancer cell proliferation</article-title><source>Oncogene</source><year>2006</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>7723</fpage><lpage>7739</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16799639</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.onc.1209757</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saitoh</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohmichi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Takahashi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawagoe</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohta</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Doshida</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Takahashi</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Igarashi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori-Abe</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Du</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsutsumi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurachi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Medroxyprogesterone acetate induces cell proliferation through up-regulation of cyclin D1 expression via phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase/Akt/nuclear factor-kappaB cascade in human breast cancer cells</article-title><source>Endocrinology</source><year>2005</year><volume>146</volume><fpage>4917</fpage><lpage>4925</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16123159</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1210/en.2004-1535</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kramer</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Seeger</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kramer</sur